{
  "version": 2,
  "note": "Holistic chest-X-ray foreign-object taxonomy. Reconciled from objcxr_eval_119 (parts), the fb reference bank (66), and supercategory organization. Nested: superclass -> concept -> parts (region masks). part_rules are per-image completeness gates for release. coco_cat_id is pinned per LEAF (part, or part-less concept) for a stable label space. v1->v2 is APPEND-ONLY on leaf ids (identity crosswalk; every v1 leaf keeps its pinned coco_cat_id) — never rename/reuse an existing leaf id; names/descriptions/grouping may change freely. v2 adds external_furniture (superimposed wheelchair/gurney/bed-rail/IV-pole, support_equipment) ecg_junction (ECG lead-block/yoke or telemetry transmitter hub, part of ecg_leads), and bra_clasp + bra_other (back hook-and-eye closure and a catch-all for strap sliders/rings, siblings of bra_underwire under breast_chestwall), and lead-tip parts pacemaker_lead_tip / icd_lead_tip / crt_lead_tip (high-contrast distal electrode/coil end, split from the thin lead body; no completeness rule so a tip without a traceable cable is allowed).",
